well, the problem it is, Castle also says, also Jeremy thought was having an affair with this bloke? How does she know that? Do you know the person who's looked into it for her? Who? Jack Straw, the future Blair Wright Home Secretary, who worked for her, looked into it, did some digging and found out basically, I don't know how they found it out, but it basically was common knowledge by this point. Wilson just wouldn't listen. He was deaf to reason. That same day that he had the lunch for Barbara Castle, he went to the Commons. He said to the Commons, Thorpe is being targeted by South African intelligence. They are using massive reserves of business, money and private agents of various kinds. He said it publicly. Anyway, we've now moved on to May
嗯，问题是，卡斯尔也说，还有杰里米·索普和这个家伙有染？她怎么知道的？你知道为她调查的人是谁吗？谁？杰克·斯特劳，未来的布莱尔派内政大臣，他为她工作，调查了一下，基本上发现了，我不知道他们是怎么发现的，但到这个时候这基本上是常识了。威尔逊就是不听。他听不进道理。就在他和芭芭拉·卡斯尔共进午餐的那天，他去了下议院。他对下议院说，索普正成为南非情报部门的目标。他们正在使用大量的商业资金和各种私人代理人。他公开说了。无论如何，我们现在已经到了五月，

