after Wilson's resignation. On the 9th of May, the Sunday Times published letters that showed that Thorpe had been having an affair with this bloke. It's that the letters, Tom, if you may recall, that have the telltale and damning phrase, bunnies can and will go to France. Spoken, very entertaining by Hugh Grant in the dramatisation of this story.
